  "text": "# MODULE 5: REPORTING OBLIGATIONS  \n## Types of Reports  \n### Suspicious Activity Report (SAR)  \n**When to File:**\n- Suspicious transaction >£5,000\n- Pattern of unusual activity\n- Potential money laundering\n- Fraud indicators\n- Sanctions list match  \n**How to File:**\n1. Document suspicious activity\n2. Report to Compliance Manager\n3. Complete SAR form\n4. Submit to FCA (within 30 days)\n5. Document filing  \n**Example:** Customer deposits £30k cash, withdraws £30k to unknown party next day → File SAR",
